          "text": "與周瑜為左右督，破曹公於烏林，又進攻南郡，走曹仁。拜裨將軍，領江夏太守，治沙羨，食四縣。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "sgz-v55-huang-gai",
      "parentKey": "sgz-v55",
      "nodeType": "biography",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "吳書·黃蓋傳",
      "locatorPath": "卷55/黃蓋傳",
      "layerRole": "structure"
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "sgz-v55-huang-gai-red-cliffs",
      "parentKey": "sgz-v55-huang-gai",
      "nodeType": "passage",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "黄盖建策火攻",
      "locatorPath": "卷55/黃蓋傳/赤壁建策火攻",
      "layerRole": "main_text",
      "layers": [
        {
          "kind": "diplomatic",
          "language": "lzh",
          "script": "Hant",
          "text": "蓋姿貌嚴毅，善於養眾，每所征討，士卒皆爭為先。建安中，隨周瑜拒曹公於赤壁，建策火攻，語在瑜傳。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "sgz-v55-huang-gai-wushu-wound",
      "parentKey": "sgz-v55-huang-gai",
      "nodeType": "quoted_fragment",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "裴注引《吴书》黄盖中矢落水",
      "locatorPath": "卷55/黃蓋傳/赤壁中矢落水/裴注引吳書",
      "layerRole": "quoted_fragment",
      "attribution": {
        "workId": "019f24ee-4c8f-7a20-8b5b-8795d01af02b",
        "type": "explicit_citation",
        "text": "《吳書》曰"
      },
      "layers": [
        {
          "kind": "quotation",
          "language": "lzh",
          "script": "Hant",
          "text": "赤壁之役，蓋為流矢所中，時寒墮水，為吳軍人所得，不知其蓋也，置廁牀中。蓋自彊以一聲呼韓當，當聞之，曰：「此公覆聲也。」向之垂涕，解易其衣，遂以得生。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "sgz-v55-han-dang",
      "parentKey": "sgz-v55",
      "nodeType": "biography",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "吳書·韓當傳",
      "locatorPath": "卷55/韓當傳",
      "layerRole": "structure"
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "sgz-v55-han-dang-red-cliffs",
      "parentKey": "sgz-v55-han-dang",
      "nodeType": "passage",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "韩当随周瑜拒破曹军",
      "locatorPath": "卷55/韓當傳/烏林及南郡戰事",
